---
description: CommerceIQ prototype UI and design-system rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `instructions.md` in the repo root for all UI work:

- Prefer `@ciq-dev/ciq-design-system` components over ad-hoc or raw shadcn.
- Lucide icons only; slate neutrals; no zinc; no hex in components.
- Tailwind 4 + CIQ tokens (`fg-*`, `canvas`, `brand-*`, `type-*` utilities).
- Read `product-context.md` for product scope and vocabulary before building flows.
